  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_3ce60ae5952645ebac42457461236666",
      "statement": "Git is a policy-free git command runner plus one identity invariant: StartAsync first runs EnsureRepositoryAsync, which throws InvalidOperationException unless `git rev-parse --show-toplevel` equals IHostEnvironment.ContentRootPath and `git remote get-url origin` parses into a RepositoryIdentity; the parsed identity is stored in Git.Repository and is the only later proof of the clone's identity.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Libs/Git.cs#L247-L251",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e2ac7c7e731cc4bd4dc6e7c530284bd03226eae5cefddde299095c0fc9d04d34:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Libs/Git.cs#L27-L60",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1d907c819332cbcb41baae1476f14dcf2fcd042d40dfd7b47f6c50fb55ac73c8:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4c5de5cc1c6f4e22a6128a99ee28f33c",
      "statement": "RepositoryIdentity.Parse handles three remote shapes with no git library: it trims whitespace and a trailing slash, strips a case-insensitive `.git` suffix, then uses `Uri.AbsolutePath` when the value contains `://` or everything after the first `:` for scp-like forms, and returns the last two path segments as owner and name — returning null for blank, colon-less, or fewer-than-two-segment values, so deeper paths collapse to the last two segments.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Libs/RepositoryIdentity.cs#L5-L43",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:82c350302cab30066216bc48c98414b01e5b884abc9ae08ee86b8d0e0c61666b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://tests/Sebastian.Tests/Libs/RepositoryIdentityTests.cs#L7-L28",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2250b172523f2c3ed54ddabc5b916366b67ab9faeb2ea4db4815ebc9e37cbb2f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_cfa90e9681564295a5c8405a3ebfad9e",
      "statement": "SyncMainAsync has exactly two call sites: Git.StartAsync under a linked CancellationTokenSource with CancelAfter of ten seconds, and GitHubWebhookProcessor.ProcessPushWebhookAsync, which awaits it inline inside the webhook request; the three-argument overload returns immediately for a deleted ref or any ref other than exactly `refs/heads/main`, so issue-branch pushes never update the mirror and there is no periodic fetch.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Libs/Git.cs#L104-L116",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:72983a7c2b480433ea4a0755b31f4d950364554ec84d000698c524f7510b68af:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Libs/Git.cs#L27-L38",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5f418e0f2612794d55341ba72ca0c72b4412cfb4c53f1671bb6affeae8530f03:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Webhooks/GitHubWebhookProcessor.cs#L107-L117",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:157fae54eb39a767fcaa9562bc592d1cfa5a6be5dadf7c984f9a08e5a9cc7400:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_79cd93bf6993495e91ad3b41dab5b5bf",
      "statement": "The sync path is fetch `--prune origin`, then FindMirrorProblemAsync, then `rev-list --count main..origin/main` with a zero-count early return, then `merge --ff-only origin/main` bracketed by rev-parse before/after; it catches InvalidOperationException (logged as a warning) and OperationCanceledException (logged at Debug), so a dirty mirror, unreachable remote, or the ten-second bound never fails startup or a webhook delivery.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Libs/Git.cs#L118-L151",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:427eb39681aa802f1bd1eb9f15c081f37900b79ace03b7c0844121b52c8d8d5e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_e0d7d48d9695431e9b265ed38659b03f",
      "statement": "FindMirrorProblemAsync returns a reason string for exactly three states, in order: not checked out on `main` (Ordinal comparison), uncommitted tracked changes detected via `status --porcelain --untracked-files=no`, and local commits ahead of origin/main via `rev-list --count origin/main..main`; the `--untracked-files=no` flag is required because the gitignored `.sebastian/` worktrees live inside the clone and would otherwise make the mirror permanently dirty.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.gitignore#L1-L1",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:1d9ee5aecff244280564786633a2e75f354d03c1a9255eaa0b77f76d7dac51ea:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Libs/Git.cs#L153-L173",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:81b2daf69aaa09e46e0e9a8016e58c6eb4e7737508cfe5c23914a8c00198e6ef:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_70cd79f85f82418cacdd7d5321d61bff",
      "statement": "The same FindMirrorProblemAsync result is handled asymmetrically: the sync path logs and skips, while ImplementSpec.PrepareWorkspaceAsync throws InvalidOperationException for a mirror problem, an issue owner/repository that does not match the parsed origin (OrdinalIgnoreCase), or a null Git.Repository (hosted service not started) — because starting an agent from an unreviewed base has no safe degraded mode.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/ImplementSpec.cs#L63-L86",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5b0fac04b714435747b217b6a5347de3ab5cf1a4f542c0d7c1a7eeb48d4dfe54:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Libs/Git.cs#L118-L151",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:427eb39681aa802f1bd1eb9f15c081f37900b79ace03b7c0844121b52c8d8d5e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_4fa90fc81e48405fa844dafd9fa32233",
      "statement": "PrepareLock is a static SemaphoreSlim(1,1) shared by every ImplementSpec instance across DI scopes, acquired before and released in a finally around the whole preparation including the fetch and fast-forward, so concurrent jobs cannot interleave mirror-rewriting operations; it is not a repository-wide lock, because once preparation returns the agent works in its own worktree with its own branch and index.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/Agent/ImplementSpec.cs#L23-L24",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:0576f1b593e9868ab2b453e66c149e20168af01fd386b5f8b9e124a0220ee8c7:"
        },
        {
