    {
      "id": "claim_a86c6f8d91ab46e08ce79677129ac816",
      "statement": "Test coverage of this area is asymmetric: ImplementSpecTests drives PrepareWorkspaceAsync against a real temporary bare-origin clone (TestRepository) and pins worktree reuse with uncommitted work preserved, recreation after `git worktree remove --force`, dirty-main rejection, and foreign-repository rejection, while SyncMainAsync has no test at all — neither the ref filter, the behind-count short-circuit, nor the swallow-on-failure behavior.",
      "evidence": [
