    {
      "id": "claim_92bdfff664824718b216fa9e5b41abb0",
      "statement": "None of the git behavior is configurable: both refs are hardcoded constants `Git.BaseBranch = \"main\"` and `Git.BaseRef = \"origin/main\"`, and there is no git section in SebastianConfig, so a repository whose default branch is not `main` cannot be served without a code change.",
