      "id": "claim_20533c40f2144dc985ceb9752aacf10b",
      "statement": "ImplementSpecTests pins four preparation behaviors against a real temporary clone: worktree reuse preserving uncommitted files, recreation after git worktree remove --force, rejection of a dirty main, and rejection of a mismatched repository; there is no test for SyncMainAsync at all.",
